"alt":"The same four-leaf sum tree drawn twice: as a tree, and as the flat list that stores it. The first preset starts at the leaf for position 1 and halves the index to climb to each parent up to the root. The second preset starts at the root and doubles the index to reach each node's children, until the leaves, which have none.",
"legendLabels":{"current":"Node in focus","compare":"Its children","done":"Already passed"},
